+Changes to the framework, source case, accepted meaning, component contracts, adapters or checker invalidate dependent current claims. Retain the original run and issue a new version-bound run. Proposed additions may improve the amended framework, but cannot be used retrospectively to score the frozen baseline as covering its test cases.
